# Storm Active Work (vault todo)

Maintain a live checklist in the **personal** vault at `Storm/Active Work.md`
using the Storm MCP. It is the short in-flight queue; `PLAN.md` remains the
decision log and milestone record.

## When to touch it

- Starting a multi-step Storm task: read Active Work first (`list_vaults` →
  `search` query `Active Work` → `get_note`).
- Finishing or blocking an item: `get_note` then `update_note` with the same
  `base_version` — check off done work, add new open items, note blockers.
- Do not leave the only status in a chat transcript.

## How

1. Vault id from `list_vaults` (name `personal`).
2. Find the note with `search` (`Active Work` or path `Storm/Active Work.md`).
3. Always `get_note` before `update_note`; send back full markdown + `base_version`.
4. Keep the note short: **Now** / **Done recently** / **Parking lot**. Link
   companion notes with wikilinks (`[[Storm Releases]]`, etc.).

## Do not

- Duplicate the whole of `PLAN.md` into the vault note.
- Create a second competing todo note; update this one.
- Skip the update because the repo `PLAN.md` already changed — update both when
  the active queue moved.
